# Working artifacts, not source.
# The design brief zip and the concept logo are superseded by
# `design_handoff_dananeh/` and `assets/brand/`; the screenshots are output
# from `scripts/screenshot.js`. They stay on disk, out of the repository.
Expo app design brief.zip
Concept-Logo.jpeg
scripts/screenshot-*.png

# Downloaded release artifacts. An APK is verified by checksum against the EAS
# build record; the binary itself never belongs in the repository.
/artifacts/
*.apk
*.aab
*.keystore
*.jks
